WEBVTT

00:00.200 --> 00:01.600
Deal.

00:03.200 --> 00:05.867
But I have one more condition.

00:07.200 --> 00:09.200
That imperial jade seal.

00:10.120 --> 00:15.960
That seal I lost it when I was driven out now.

00:16.040 --> 00:19.560
I don't know where it is forget it.

00:20.320 --> 00:21.720
This deal is done.

00:22.400 --> 00:24.000
Thank you, Your Highness.

00:33.080 --> 00:35.720
Your Highness should we give him the full amount?

00:35.880 --> 00:41.640
If we give too little they might not put in effort if we give too much they might have other ideas.

00:43.280 --> 00:46.680
Give them six hundred sets in batches.

00:47.480 --> 00:48.760
Yes.

00:54.000 --> 00:56.420
Though a small enemy contingent was repelled, resources were exhausted, leaving the army with no choice but to adopt a defensive stance and await an opportunity.

00:56.500 --> 01:06.500
Though they barely obtained six hundred suits of armor, Shi Lang in the end had no choice but to grit his teeth and cooperate, leading the newly armed troops to intercept the Qingzhou Army.

